@startuml SEQ_06_MELIHAT_REKAP_ABSENSI
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-06: Melihat Rekap Absensi

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Kadep" as Viewer
boundary    "Browser"               as Browser
control     "AbsensiController"     as Controller
entity      "Absensi Model"         as Model
entity      "JadwalPiket Model"     as ModelJadwal
database    "absensi"               as DB

== Lihat Rekap Absensi ==

Viewer  -> Browser     : Buka menu Rekap Absensi
Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/rekap-absen
Controller -> Model    : Query semua absensi berdasarkan kepengurusan lab
Model -> DB            : SELECT absensi WHERE kepengurusan_lab_id = ?
DB      --> Model      : Data absensi
Model --> Controller   : Data absensi
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman rekap absensi
Browser --> Viewer     : Tampil tabel rekap per asisten + persentase kehadiran

== Lihat Riwayat Absensi (Detail User) ==

Viewer  -> Browser     : Klik nama asisten / menu Riwayat
Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/absensi/riwayat
Controller -> ModelJadwal : Query jadwal asisten
ModelJadwal -> DB         : SELECT jadwal_piket WHERE user_id = ? AND kepengurusan_lab_id = ?
DB      --> ModelJadwal   : Data jadwal
ModelJadwal --> Controller : Data jadwal
Controller -> Model       : Query riwayat absensi asisten
Model -> DB               : SELECT absensi WHERE user_id = ? AND kepengurusan_lab_id = ?
DB      --> Model         : Data riwayat absensi
Model --> Controller      : Data riwayat absensi
Controller --> Browser    : Render halaman riwayat absensi
Browser --> Viewer        : Tampil riwayat check-in/out per tanggal

@enduml
